# Per-Dockerfile ignore for Dockerfile.local (BuildKit uses <dockerfile>.dockerignore
# in preference to .dockerignore). The runtime-only image needs the host-built
# fat-jar and the seed defaults, so exclude everything else and keep the build
# context tiny.
*
!turing-app/
turing-app/*
!turing-app/target/
turing-app/target/*
!turing-app/target/viglet-turing.jar

# T373 added a `seed` build stage that runs `COPY seed/defaults /seed/defaults`,
# and this file — written before it — still allowed the jar alone, so the build
# failed with `"/seed/defaults": not found` on a path that exists in the repo.
# An allowlist has to be re-opened for every new COPY source; this is that entry.
!seed/
seed/*
!seed/defaults/
